{"id":"n24966-1-7","stage":1,"title":"재채기 · 打喷嚏","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24966-1-7-1","ko":"콧물과 재채기가 나는 것 말고 다른 증상은 없나요?","zh":"除了流鼻涕和打喷嚏之外，还有其他症状吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"콧물과","meaning":"鼻涕，鼻水","explanation":"콧물：鼻涕，鼻水；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"콧물","audio":"/audio/8ba5845818eda8819b8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81350","senseId":"1","lemma":"콧물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"재채기가","meaning":"打喷嚏","explanation":"재채기：打喷嚏；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"재채기","audio":"/audio/89fa9bcbed0e9260d5e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24966","senseId":"1","lemma":"재채기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나는","meaning":"发，闹","explanation":"나다：发，闹；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"20","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말고","meaning":"不做","explanation":"말다：不做；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"증상은","meaning":"病情，症状","explanation":"증상：病情，症状；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"증상","audio":"/audio/d9557e2ccf323459c468.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91880","senseId":"1","lemma":"증상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없나요?","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"3","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8ba5845818eda881","term":"콧물","zh":"鼻涕，鼻水","audio":"/audio/8ba5845818eda8819b8a.mp3","entryId":"81350","definition":"从鼻孔里流出来的粘粘糊糊的液体。","pronunciation":["콘물"]},{"id":"89fa9bcbed0e9260","term":"재채기","zh":"打喷嚏","audio":"/audio/89fa9bcbed0e9260d5e5.mp3","entryId":"24966","definition":"鼻子里受到刺激，急剧吸气，然后很快由鼻孔喷出并发出声音的现象。","pronunciation":["재채기"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发，闹","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"身体上产生某种现象或生病。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不做","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不做某事；或指不是。","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"d9557e2ccf323459","term":"증상","zh":"病情，症状","audio":"/audio/d9557e2ccf323459c468.mp3","entryId":"91880","definition":"患病时出现的各种状态。","pronunciation":["증상"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不发生某个事情或症状。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/6c476a857bd595173582.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24966-1-7-2","ko":"열이 나고 추워서 몸이 떨려요.","zh":"我发烧了，还觉得冷，身体一直在发抖。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"열이","meaning":"热，烧","explanation":"열：热，烧；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"열","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67807","senseId":"1","lemma":"열","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나고","meaning":"发，闹","explanation":"나다：发，闹；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"나다",